{
    "title": "Pepper - Recipes with Friends",
    "description": "Build your Social Cookbook with Pepper - the social cooking community of 1M+ to creating & discovering tasty recipes with friends!\r\n\r\n* Import any recipe from the Internet!\r\n* Transfer any recipe from your Notes with our Smart Paste tool\r\n* Order ingredients from your favorite recipe for delivery via Instacart\r\n* Track your progress with Collections of Saved recipes\r\n* Experience interactive & easy-to-follow recipe videos\r\n* Advanced search by ingredient, dietary preference, course, & more to help find the perfect recipes\r\n* Cook and review friends, family, & community meals through seamless recipe sharing\r\n\r\nWhether you're a home cook finding, creating, enjoying, or sharing your tasty recipes - Pepper streamlines the process of cooking every step of the way to help YOU expand your food network & build your digital cookbook. Recipe sharing has never been easier!\r\n\r\nFINALLY, the social cooking platform to create, share, and discover tasty food with family, friends, and everyone else you bring into your food network! So broaden your food network & expand your culinary horizons by downloading Pepper today.\r\n\r\nEvery chef deserves an audience. And recipe sharing has never been this fun! So come cook with us :)",
    "descriptionHTML": "Build your Social Cookbook with Pepper - the social cooking community of 1M+ to creating &amp; discovering tasty recipes with friends!<br><br>* Import any recipe from the Internet!<br>* Transfer any recipe from your Notes with our Smart Paste tool<br>* Order ingredients from your favorite recipe for delivery via Instacart<br>* Track your progress with Collections of Saved recipes<br>* Experience interactive &amp; easy-to-follow recipe videos<br>* Advanced search by ingredient, dietary preference, course, &amp; more to help find the perfect recipes<br>* Cook and review friends, family, &amp; community meals through seamless recipe sharing<br><br>Whether you&#39;re a home cook finding, creating, enjoying, or sharing your tasty recipes - Pepper streamlines the process of cooking every step of the way to help YOU expand your food network &amp; build your digital cookbook. Recipe sharing has never been easier!<br><br>FINALLY, the social cooking platform to create, share, and discover tasty food with family, friends, and everyone else you bring into your food network! So broaden your food network &amp; expand your culinary horizons by downloading Pepper today.<br><br>Every chef deserves an audience. And recipe sharing has never been this fun! So come cook with us :)",
